#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:3
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &xsldbg;"
msgstr "Upotreba &xsldbg;"

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "xsldbg command arguments"
msgstr "xsldbg argumenti naredbe"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:6
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On systems with readline library available you can use the back/forward keys "
"to navigate the history of entered commands. On all systems the last entered "
"command can be repeated by just pressing the &lt;ENTER&gt; key."
msgstr ""
"Na sistema sa readline bibliotekom koja je dostupna možete koristiti nazad/"
"naprijed ključeve za navigaciju historije unesenih komandi. Na svim "
"sistemima posljednja naredbu može se ponoviti  samo pritiskom na &lt;"
"ENTER&gt;."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "If your operating system supports it file names will be expanded."
msgstr ""
"Ako je vaš operativni sistem podržava, imena datoteka će biti proširena."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Several commands take more that one argument. Quotes may be used to lead to "
"complex expressions being treated as one argument. eg break &quot;* | "
"@&quot; would allow you to see a breakpoint on the template with the name "
"&quot;* | @&quot;"
msgstr ""
"Neke komande uzimaju više od jednog argumenta. Citati se mogu koristiti da "
"dovedu da se složenih izraza tretira kao jedan argument. eg break &quot;* | "
"@&quot; vam dopuštaju da vidite tašćku prekida na šablonu sa imenom &quot;* "
"| @&quot;"

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "Legend of terms"
msgstr "Legenda termina"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The following table describes the terms used in the subsequent command guide"
msgstr ""
"Sljedeća tablica opisuje termine koji se koriste u kasnijim naredbu vodiča"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"TEMPLATE_NAME : A valid template name contains only ASCII character codes "
"0x00 to 0x7F. And can be a fully qualified name ie \"xsl:templateName\"."
msgstr ""
"TEMPLATE_NAME : Validno ime šablona sadrži samo ASCII karaktere kodirane od "
"0x00 do 0x7F. I može biti potpuno kvalificirano ime tj \"xsl:templateName\"."

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"FILENAME : A valid file name local to the system of the user. It can have a "
"\"~\" prefix on *nix and CYGWIN platforms. Or environment variables under "
"RISC OS"
msgstr ""
"FILENAME : Važeće ime lokalnoj datoteci na sistem korisnika. Može imati \"~"
"\" prefiks na *nix i CYGWIN platforme.Ili varijable okruženja pod RISC OS"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "URI : A Uniform Resource Identifiers as defined by RFC 2396"
msgstr "URI: Uniformni Resurs Pokazatelji definisani kao RFC 2396"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"MODE_NAME The mode of template which can be fully qualified name ie \"xsl:"
"modeName\"."
msgstr ""
"MODE_NAME Način šablona koja može biti potpuno kvalificirano ime tj \"xsl:"
"modeName\"."

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "QNAME : A fully qualified name ie \"xsl:localPart\""
msgstr "QNAME : Potpuno kvalifikovano ime tj \"xsl:localPart\""

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "LINENO : A valid line number in associated &lt;FILENAME&gt;"
msgstr "LINENO : Važeći broj linije povezan sa &lt;FILENAME&gt;"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "NUMBER_OF_FRAMES : A valid line number frames to change position by"
msgstr "NUMBER_OF_FRAMES : Važeći broj linija uokviruje promijeni položaja"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "BREAKPOINT_ID : A valid break point number"
msgstr "BREAKPOINT_ID : Validan broj tačke prekida"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"WATCH_ID : A valid watch expression number as indicated by showwatch command"
msgstr ""
"WATCH_ID :  Validan broj izražavanja kao što je navedeno od strane showwatch "
"komande"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "SPEED: speed to walk through code at, between 0 to 9"
msgstr "SPEED: brzinu kretanja kroz kod na, između 0 do 9"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(Comment)</emphasis>: a comment about "
"command meaning or usage"
msgstr ""
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(Comment)</emphasis>: komentar o značenju "
"ili upotrebi komande"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "{ opt1 | opt2 | opt2 .. etc} : Choose one of the opt's"
msgstr "{ opt1 | opt2 | opt2 .. etc} :Odaberite jednu od opt-a"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "XPATH : a xpath selection of node(s)"
msgstr "XPATH : izbor xpath čvora/čvorova"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid "PARAM_ID : a valid parameter number as indicated by showparam command"
msgstr ""
"PARAM_ID : Važeći broj parametra kao što je navedeno od strane showparam "
"komande"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "PARAM_NAME : a valid parameter name as indicated by showparam command"
msgstr ""
"PARAM_NAME : Važeće ime parametra kao što je navedeno od strane showparam "
"komande"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"PATH : A path to change working directory to. On some operating systems a \"~"
"\" prefix will be replaced by your home directory path"
msgstr ""
"PATH : Put do promjene u radnom imeniku. Na nekim operativnim sistemima \"~"
"\" prefiks će zamijeniti vaš put home direktorija"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"TEXT : Free form text &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(no restrictions)</"
"emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"TEXT : Slobodna forma teksta &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<emphasis>(no "
"restrictions)</emphasis>"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "COMMAND : A valid command for the xsdbg"
msgstr "COMMAND : Validna komanda za xsdbg"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "QNAME : A valid variable/parameter name"
msgstr "QNAME : Validno ime promjenjive/parametra"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"SOURCE : The stylesheet being/to be executed. See &lt;FILENAME&gt; and &lt;"
"URI&gt;"
msgstr "SOURCE : Stil je/će biti executed. Kao &lt;FILENAME&gt; i &lt;URI&gt;"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"DATA : The xml data(document) being/to be processed by the stylesheet. See "
"&lt;FILENAME&gt; and &lt;URI&gt;"
msgstr ""
"DATA : xml podatak(dokument) je/će biti procesuiran od strane stila. Kao &lt;"
"FILENAME&gt; i &lt;URI&gt;"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "DEVICE_PATH : Is a valid terminal on the operating system"
msgstr "DEVICE_PATH : Je važeći terminal na operativnom sistemu"

#. Tag: entry
#: usage.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "TTY_LEVEL : Is a valid level of input/output to use"
msgstr "TTY_LEVEL : Je validan nivo ulaza/izlaza za korištenje"

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "Overview of available commands"
msgstr "Pregled dostupnih komandi"

